+/// Where the sun and moon are as the time of day puts them (`day` 0.25 rising in the east,
+/// 0.5 overhead, 0.75 setting in the west; the moon across from it), block space; how much of
+/// each shows (the sun as much as its daylight reaches the ground, so not in an eclipse; the
